## Key Optimization Areas Identified

### 1. AI Service (aiService.ts)
- **Issue:** No request timeouts on AI provider calls
- **Issue:** No circuit breaker for provider health monitoring
- **Solution:** Implement timeout wrapper and circuit breaker pattern

### 2. Waterfall Service (waterfallService.ts)
- **Issue:** JSON parsing could fail silently with large responses
- **Issue:** No timeout on provider.complete() calls
- **Solution:** Add timeout mechanism and better error handling

### 3. Vector Service (vectorService.ts)
- **Issue:** Brute force search for all queries (O(n))
- **Issue:** HNSW index initialization blocks startup
- **Issue:** No connection pooling for embedding APIs
- **Solution:** Multi-tier search, async HNSW init, connection pooling

### 4. Context Service (contextService.ts)
- **Issue:** No caching for mode instructions (reads file every time)
- **Issue:** Full BM25 rebuild instead of incremental updates
- **Solution:** LRU cache, incremental BM25 updates

### 5. Supervisor Service (supervisorService.ts)
- **Issue:** Tight coupling between services
- **Issue:** Synchronous operations could block
- **Solution:** Event coordinator for decoupling

### 6. Plugin Manager (pluginManager.ts)
- **Issue:** Sequential initialization (slow)
- **Issue:** No timeout on plugin initialization
- **Solution:** Parallel initialization with timeouts

### 7. HNSW Index (hnswIndex.ts)
- **Issue:** Sequential file I/O
- **Issue:** No error recovery
- **Solution:** Chunked I/O, error boundaries

### 8. Memory Consolidation Service (memoryConsolidationService.ts)
- **Issue:** No retry mechanism for failed jobs
- **Issue:** Silent failures
- **Solution:** Retry logic with exponential backoff
